---
title: Runtime Workflow
---

sequenceDiagram

    participant User
    participant Dashboard
    participant Tracker
    participant Endpoint
    participant Logs

    User->>Dashboard: Open Dashboard

    loop Every 3 Seconds

        Tracker->>Endpoint: Scan Local RPC Endpoints
        Endpoint-->>Tracker: Telemetry Payload

        Tracker->>Logs: Read Session Logs
        Logs-->>Tracker: Usage Records

        Tracker->>Tracker: Parse Quotas
        Tracker->>Tracker: Recover Missing Fields
        Tracker->>Tracker: Calculate Resets

        Tracker-->>Dashboard: Updated State

    end

    Dashboard-->>User: Render Updated Metrics